      ex: ['Xushmuomalalik ingliz madaniyatida juda muhim. “Excuse me” — e’tibor jalb qilish yoki yo‘l so‘rashdan oldin aytiladi. “Thank you” — rahmat; javobi “You’re welcome” (arzimaydi). “Pardon?” — gapni eshitmay qolsangiz, qaytarishni so‘rash. “Of course” — albatta, “No problem” — muammo yo‘q.\nIltimosni “Could you…, please?” bilan boshlasangiz yanada xushmuomala bo‘ladi: “Could you help me, please?”', 'Politeness matters a lot in English. “Excuse me” gets someone’s attention or starts a question. “Thank you” is answered with “You’re welcome”. “Pardon?” asks someone to repeat. “Of course” means yes, certainly; “No problem” means it is fine.\nRequests sound even politer with “Could you…, please?”: “Could you help me, please?”'],
