      g: [['“Thank you!” — “You’re ___.”', 'welcome', 'sorry', 'please', '“Thank you” ga “You’re welcome” deb javob beriladi.'], ['___ me, where is the station?', 'Excuse', 'Thanks', 'Please', 'Yo‘l so‘rashdan oldin “Excuse me” aytamiz.']],
